General_SiSo_Auto_fault_check_after_RMOD_crash
    [Documentation]
    ...  General test case for alarm check after RMOD crash due to its process being killed. Additional fault signature check is performed when
    ...  'verify_fault_signature_alarm' argument is set to True. L3call will be executed before and after RMOD power reset when 'throughputs'
    ...  argument is provided.
    ...
    ...  ARGS:
    ...  :param str rmod_id: (Mandatory) : configuration id of rmod to be crashed by process kill, e.g.: 1
    ...  :param str process_name: (Optional) : fault name of the process to kill on RMOD; defaults to uCcsSicFtpDaemon
    ...  :param str fault_name: (Optional) : fault name of the alarm to be verified after RMOD reset caused by process crash; defaults to 'Fault signature for crash or failure'
    ...  :param str/int fault_id: (Optional) : fault id of the alarm to be verified after RMOD reset caused by process crash; defaults to '4590'
    ...  :param str fault_activation_timeout: (Optional) : time to wait for alarm activation after RMOD reset caused by process crash; defaults to 300s
    ...  :param str fault_inactivation_timeout: (Optional) : time to wait for alarm inactivation after RMOD reset caused by process crash; defaults to 60s
    ...  :param bool verify_fault_signature_alarm: (Optional) : True - alarm's fault signature verification will be performed after RMOD reset caused by process crash
    ...                                                         False - alarm's fault signature verification will NOT be performed; defaults to True
    ...  :param str fault_signature_category: (Optional) : expected value of 'Category' field in fault signature, e.g.: 'SW_FAILURE'; defaults to None
    ...                                                    means that field will not be verified.
    ...  :param str fault_signature_scope: (Optional) : expected value of 'Scope' field in fault signature, e.g.: 'RFM'; defaults to None
    ...                                                 means that field will not be verified.
    ...  :param str fault_signature_minor: (Optional) : expected value of 'Minor' field in fault signature, e.g.: 'RFM_GPP'; defaults to
    ...                                                 None means that field will not be verified.
    ...  :param str fault_signature_rfm_gpp: (Optional) : expected value of 'RfmGpp' field in fault signature, e.g.: '0'; defaults to None
    ...                                                    means that field will not be verified.
    ...  :param str fault_signature_rfm_cpri: (Optional) : expected value of 'RfmCpri' field in fault signature, e.g.: '0'; defaults to None
    ...                                                    means that field will not be verified.
    ...  :param str fault_signature_rfm_fpga: (Optional) : expected value of 'RfmFpga' field in fault signature, e.g.: '0'; defaults to None
    ...                                                    means that field will not be verified.
    ...  :param str fault_signature_info: (Optional) : expected value of 'Info' field in fault signature, e.g.: 'Power off due to operator action';
    ...                                                defaults to None means that field will not be verified.
    ...  :param str fault_signature_extra_info: (Optional) : expected value of 'ExtraInfo' field in fault signature, e.g.: 'Power off via OAM';
    ...                                                      defaults to None means that field will not be verified.
    ...  :param dict throughputs: (Optional) : dict with throughput and deviation values for each cell identified by
    ...                                        it's nrCellIdentity for NR cells, eutranCellId for LTE cells, wnCelId for WCDMA cells;
    ...                                        defaults to None (L3 call will not be executed).
    ...                                        Example:
    ...                                            {
    ...                                              '827736065':
    ...                                                    {
    ...                                                       'throughput':
    ...                                                           {
    ...                                                               'downlink': '100 Mbits/sec',
    ...                                                               'uplink': '15 Mbits/sec'
    ...                                                           },
    ...                                                       'deviation': '90%'
    ...                                                   },
    ...                                          }
    ...  :param str protocol: (Optional) : data transfer protocol; defaults to UDP.
    ...  :param str udp_buffer: (Optional) : monitoring data buffer; defaults to 4M.
    ...  :param int tput_duration (Optional) : duration of data transfer in seconds; defaults to 30
    ...  :param bool tput_verification_via_btslog: (Optional) : True - throughput verification will be performed using btslog
    ...                                                         False - throuput verification will be performed using iperf; defaults to False
    ...  :param dict ue_network_modes: (Optional) : dict with UE serial numbers and desired network modes e.g. {"SN1234": "NR_only"}
    ...                                             possible UE network modes: NR_only, LTE_only, NR_LTE
    ...                                             when using more than one UE please make sure that the modes you choose are either all
    ...                                             with "_only" suffix or all "NR_LTE" as it is not yet possible to mix those.
    ...                                             mandatory for SA+NSA setups, defaults to None8", "ssb_32",
    ...                                             default None means default WebEM value will not be changed.
    ...  :param dict ues_and_cells: dict with UE serial numbers and lists of configuration distnames of cells to which they
    ...                             can be attached e.g. {"SN1234": ["MRBTS-50146/NRBTS-1/NRCELL-1", "MRBTS-50146/NRBTS-1/NRCELL-3"],
    ...                             "SN5678": ["MRBTS-50146/NRBTS-1/NRCELL-5"]}
    ...                             defaults to ${None} which means that all UEs will be attached to all cells.
    ...                             when given, listed cells will be called in pairs with specified UEs, if there are more
    ...                             cells on the setup that were not mentioned in the list, they will be called with all UEs

    [Arguments]    ${rmod_id}
    ...            ${process_name}=uCcsSicFtpDaemon
    ...            ${fault_name}=Fault signature for crash or failure
    ...            ${fault_id}=4590
    ...            ${fault_activation_timeout}=300s
    ...            ${fault_inactivation_timeout}=60s
    ...            ${verify_fault_signature_alarm}=${True}
    ...            ${fault_signature_category}=${None}
    ...            ${fault_signature_scope}=${None}
    ...            ${fault_signature_minor}=${None}
    ...            ${fault_signature_rfm_gpp}=${None}
    ...            ${fault_signature_rfm_cpri}=${None}
    ...            ${fault_signature_rfm_fpga}=${None}
    ...            ${fault_signature_info}=${None}
    ...            ${fault_signature_extra_info}=${None}
    ...            ${throughputs}=${None}
    ...            ${protocol}=udp
    ...            ${udp_buffer}=4M
    ...            ${tput_duration}=30
    ...            ${tput_verification_via_btslog}=${False}
    ...            ${ue_network_modes}=${None}
    ...            ${ues_and_cells}=${None}

    [Timeout]      24 hours
    ${bts_type}=                                            hwpta_testline.get_type_of_setup
    Create admin session with default alias                 bts_type=${bts_type}
    ${connection}=                                          connections.get_default_admin_connection_alias
    ...                                                     bts_type=${bts_type}
    ${rmod_serial_number}=                                  admin_info_model.get_serial_number_for_rmod
    ...                                                     rmod_id=${rmod_id}
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}
    ${sw_version}=                                          sbts_admin.get_sw_version
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}
    ${all_cells_of_rmod}=                                   admin_info_model.get_configuration_distnames_of_all_cells_for_rmod
    ...                                                     rmod_id=${rmod_id}
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}

    ${expected_fault_signature}=                            Run Keyword If    ${verify_fault_signature_alarm}
    ...                                                     Create Expected Fault Signature
    ...                                                     fault_signature_category=${fault_signature_category}
    ...                                                     fault_load_name=${sw_version}
    ...                                                     fault_signature_scope=${fault_signature_scope}
    ...                                                     fault_signature_component=${rmod_serial_number}
    ...                                                     fault_signature_minor=${fault_signature_minor}
    ...                                                     fault_signature_rfm_gpp=${fault_signature_rfm_gpp}
    ...                                                     fault_signature_rfm_cpri=${fault_signature_rfm_cpri}
    ...                                                     fault_signature_rfm_fpga=${fault_signature_rfm_fpga}
    ...                                                     fault_signature_info=${fault_signature_info}
    ...                                                     fault_signature_extra_info=${fault_signature_extra_info}
    ...                                                     ELSE
    ...                                                     Set Variable
    ...                                                     ${None}

    run keyword if                                          ${throughputs}
    ...                                                     Execute L3 call
    ...                                                     cells_distnames=${all_cells_of_rmod}
    ...                                                     throughputs=${throughputs}
    ...                                                     protocol=${protocol}
    ...                                                     udp_buffer=${udp_buffer}
    ...                                                     tput_verification_via_btslog=${tput_verification_via_btslog}
    ...                                                     ue_network_modes=${ue_network_modes}
    ...                                                     ues_and_cells=${ues_and_cells}

    Alarms.Allow alarm                                      fault_id=10
    ...                                                     alarm_id=7116
    ...                                                     severity=Critical
    ...                                                     bts_type=${bts_type}
    Alarms.Allow alarm                                      fault_id=4590
    ...                                                     alarm_id=7115
    ...                                                     severity=Warning
    ...                                                     bts_type=${bts_type}

    Kill Process on RMOD and Wait for RMOD Autonomous Reset
    ...                                                     rmod_id=${rmod_id}
    ...                                                     process_name=${process_name}
    ...                                                     root_process=${False}
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}

    Robot Log Step                                          Waiting for RMOD-${rmod_id} offline status after autonomous reset...
    Wait Until Keyword Succeeds                             5min
    ...                                                     10sec
    ...                                                     status_check.verify_statuses_of_rmod
    ...                                                     status_variant=offline
    ...                                                     rmod_id=${rmod_id}
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}
    
    Robot Log Step                                          Waiting for alarm '${fault_name}' (FID: '${fault_id}') activation...
    Wait for active alarm                                   timeout=${fault_activation_timeout}
    ...                                                     fault_name=${fault_name}
    ...                                                     fault_id=${fault_id}
    ...                                                     fault_signature=${expected_fault_signature}
    ...                                                     bts_type=${bts_type}

    Run keyword if    """${expected_fault_signature}"""!="""${None}"""
    ...                                                     Run keywords
    ...                                                     Robot Log Operation
    ...                                                     Verifying Date and Reset Counter in Fault Signature...
    ...                                                     AND
    ...                                                     Verify Date and Reset Counter in Fault Signature Not Empty
    ...                                                     fault_id=${fault_id}
    ...                                                     fault_name=${fault_name}

    Robot Log Step                                          Waiting for alarm '${fault_name}' (FID: '${fault_id}') inactivation...
    Wait for inactive alarm                                 timeout=${fault_inactivation_timeout}
    ...                                                     fault_name=${fault_name}
    ...                                                     fault_id=${fault_id}
    ...                                                     fault_signature=${expected_fault_signature}
    ...                                                     bts_type=${bts_type}

    Robot Log Step                                          Waiting for RMOD-${rmod_id} online status after autonomous reset...
    Wait Until Keyword Succeeds                             1min
    ...                                                     10sec
    ...                                                     status_check.verify_statuses_of_rmod
    ...                                                     status_variant=online
    ...                                                     rmod_id=${rmod_id}
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}

    Alarms.Disallow alarm                                   fault_id=10
    ...                                                     alarm_id=7116
    ...                                                     severity=Critical
    ...                                                     bts_type=${bts_type}

    Robot Log Operation                                     Verifying RMODs and their Cells statuses after RMOD-${rmod_id} autonomous reset...
    Wait Until Keyword Succeeds                             3min
    ...                                                     20sec
    ...                                                     Check all BBMODs RMODs and cells states for all RATs
    ...                                                     bts_type=${bts_type}
    Robot Log Result                                        RMODs and Cells statuses validation finished successfully after autonomous reset.

    run keyword if                                          ${throughputs}
    ...                                                     Execute L3 call
    ...                                                     cells_distnames=${all_cells_of_rmod}
    ...                                                     throughputs=${throughputs}
    ...                                                     protocol=${protocol}
    ...                                                     udp_buffer=${udp_buffer}
    ...                                                     tput_verification_via_btslog=${tput_verification_via_btslog}
    ...                                                     ue_network_modes=${ue_network_modes}
    ...                                                     ues_and_cells=${ues_and_cells}
